    {
      "label": "Industries We Serve",
      "html": "<section class=\"section alt industries-section\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\"><div><h2>Industries We Serve</h2></div><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/industries\">View all <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9\"/></svg></a></div>\n  <div class=\"ai-tab-wrap\" data-ind-tabs>\n  <div class=\"hero-sticky\">\n    <div class=\"tabs-wrapper\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Industries we serve\">\n      <span class=\"droplet-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn is-on\" role=\"tab\" data-ind-tab=\"0\" aria-selected=\"true\">Healthcare and Life Sciences</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-ind-tab=\"1\" aria-selected=\"false\">Education</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-ind-tab=\"2\" aria-selected=\"false\">Banking and Finance</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-ind-tab=\"3\" aria-selected=\"false\">Logistics</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-ind-tab=\"4\" aria-selected=\"false\">Retail and E-commerce</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-ind-tab=\"5\" aria-selected=\"false\">Manufacturing</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-stage\">\n      <span class=\"card-bg-mesh\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <div class=\"tab-slides\"><div class=\"tab-slide is-on\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-label=\"Healthcare and Life Sciences\">\n  <div class=\"slide-media\"><img src=\"/assets/images/industry-healthcare.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/images/industry-healthcare-800.webp 800w, /assets/images/industry-healthcare.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 1200px\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"401\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n  <div class=\"slide-copy\"><h3>Healthcare and Life Sciences</h3><p>Give your care teams their time back. Our business technology solutions connect care, claims and reporting, and add AI-assisted diagnostics under ISO 27001 certified processes.</p><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/industries/education\" aria-label=\"Know more about Healthcare and Life Sciences\">Know More <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9\"/></svg></a></div>\n</div><div class=\"tab-slide\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-label=\"Education\">\n  <div class=\"slide-media\"><img src=\"/assets/images/industry-education.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/images/industry-education-800.webp 800w, /assets/images/industry-education.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 1200px\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"401\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n  <div class=\"slide-copy\"><h3>Education</h3><p>Answer student questions in seconds. We built an AI student assistant for a leading Australian EdTech organisation that responds from live LMS data and policy documents.</p><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/industries/education\" aria-label=\"Know more about Education\">Know More <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9\"/></svg></a></div>\n</div><div class=\"tab-slide\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-label=\"Banking and Finance\">\n  <div class=\"slide-media\"><img src=\"/assets/images/industry-finance.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/images/industry-finance-800.webp 800w, /assets/images/industry-finance.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 1200px\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"401\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n  <div class=\"slide-copy\"><h3>Banking and Finance</h3><p>Slow lending platforms and late collections cost you revenue. Our digital transformation services modernise lending and collections, and predictive analytics flag default risk early, with a full audit trail.</p><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/industries/education\" aria-label=\"Know more about Banking and Finance\">Know More <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9\"/></svg></a></div>\n</div><div class=\"tab-slide\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-label=\"Logistics\">\n  <div class=\"slide-media\"><img src=\"/assets/images/industry-logistics.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/images/industry-logistics-800.webp 800w, /assets/images/industry-logistics.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 1200px\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"401\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n  <div class=\"slide-copy\"><h3>Logistics</h3><p>Inventory errors and costly returns eat into your margin. For an Australian warehouse management company, we improved inventory accuracy by 70% and cut order returns by 60% with custom enterprise software solutions.</p><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/industries/education\" aria-label=\"Know more about Logistics\">Know More <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9\"/></svg></a></div>\n</div><div class=\"tab-slide\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-label=\"Retail and E-commerce\">\n  <div class=\"slide-media\"><img src=\"/assets/images/appinv-ecommerce.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"401\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n  <div class=\"slide-copy\"><h3>Retail and E-commerce</h3><p>We have expertise in developing AI for personalised product search and recommendations, backed by unified customer data and the commerce and loyalty platforms that turn browsers into buyers.</p><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/industries/education\" aria-label=\"Know more about Retail and E-commerce\">Know More <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9\"/></svg></a></div>\n</div><div class=\"tab-slide\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-label=\"Manufacturing\">\n  <div class=\"slide-media\"><img src=\"/assets/images/appinv-svc-software.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"401\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n  <div class=\"slide-copy\"><h3>Manufacturing</h3><p>Connect your entire factory with real-time production monitoring, predictive maintenance and shop-floor automation across every line, using enterprise AI solutions integrated with your ERP.</p><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"https://www.q3tech.com/manufacturing-software-development/\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Know more about Manufacturing\">Know More <svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9\"/></svg></a></div>\n</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div></section>",
      "blockName": "Industries We Serve",
      "blockType": "htmlSection"
    },
